s from one of these conferences that, like, wow, that really was something neat and special that happened at the conference that was something you remember from previous years? Well, I mean, we've had a lot of good speakers come through through the years. I mean, the improv that we had yesterday was pretty great. We previewed that at one of our earlier conferences this year.

